abstract: >-
  LongChat Guard is an open-source, local-first Chrome and Microsoft Edge browser
  extension for ChatGPT long-conversation warnings. It learns empirical browser-side
  safe/failure boundaries and typical assistant-reply growth, provides simple risk
  states and continuation workflows, and does not claim access to OpenAI's official
  token quota or exact context-window limit.
